    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That lock analogy helps. I guess I'm just really paranoid about things happening \"behind the scenes.\" Like, are there specific types of malicious activity where someone just slips into the system quietly and stays there, almost like they're living in the shadows of my database? How do I catch something that isn't making a big noise?",
